The `CustomMetadata` XML was being parsed with the `field`/`value` pairs flattened directly under `<values>`, so all four pairs were folded into a **single** `CustomMetadataValue` item → *"Element field is duplicated at this location in type CustomMetadataValue"*. Each field/value pair is now wrapped in its own `<CustomMetadataValue>` element (one item per field, each with exactly one `field` and one `value`), keeping the explicit `xsi:type` on every value.

